{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wj9nta6mJvyHL6wApVkbwh","type":"tool_result","content":"total 10024\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 9 user  wheel      288 Nov  4 21:21 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 5 user  wheel      160 Nov  4 21:21 ..\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel     3474 Nov  4 21:21 TASK.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel   143018 Nov  4 21:22 editor.log\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel      448 Nov  4 21:21 embed.py\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel     1829 Nov  4 21:21 evidence.csv\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel   655616 Nov  4 21:21 evidence_M.npz\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel      929 Nov  4 21:21 scorer.py\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel  4263734 Nov  4 21:21 scorer_in.npz\n\"\"\"Laya scorer helper. M: [n, 5, 1024] marker vectors (one per department option).\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np, torch\nDEPTS = [\"cards\", \"disputes\", \"transfers_topups\", \"fees_fx\", \"account_security\"]\ndef load(path):\n    d = np.load(path); return {k: d[k] for k in d.files}\ndef save(S, path):\n    np.savez(path, **S)\ndef gelu(x):\n    return 0.5 * x * (1 + torch.erf(torch.from_numpy(np.ascontiguousarray(x)) / np.sqrt(2)).numpy())\ndef logits(S, M):\n    mu = M.mean(-1, keepdims=True); var = M.var(-1, keepdims=True)\n    h = (M - mu) / np.sqrt(var + 1e-5) * S[\"ln_w\"] + S[\"ln_b\"]\n    z = (gelu(h @ S[\"W1\"] + S[\"b1\"]) @ S[\"W2\"] + S[\"b2\"])[..., 0]\n    i, e = 0, M\n    while f\"extra_W{i}\" in S:\n        e = e @ S[f\"extra_W{i}\"] + S[f\"extra_b{i}\"]\n        if f\"extra_W{i + 1}\" in S:\n            e = np.maximum(e, 0)\n        i += 1\n    return z + e[..., 0] if i else z\ndef predict(S, M):\n    return [DEPTS[i] for i in logits(S, M).argmax(-1)]\ntext\tcorrect\nWhat are the age requirements for service?\taccount_security\nCan you tell me what countries you offer support for?\taccount_security\nCan I get a card even though I live in the US\taccount_security\nIs it possible to get a card outside the UK?\taccount_security\nHow old do my kids need to be to use your service?\taccount_secu