{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011Cij9B8WJwpECHA7uEFeSx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Step 1 notes\n2\t\n3\t**Finding.** The marker vectors are almost one scalar: two principal components (a curved \"match score\" arc) carry 99.6% of the variance and reproduce the original logits to 0.01 RMSE. Slot identity and message topic live in tiny directions in components 16 and beyond.\n4\t\n5\t**Change.** The original scorer weights are untouched. I added a 4-layer ReLU module: `e = 4.5 * min(band, gate_slot, gate_topic)`.\n6\t\n7\t- `band`: match score (PC0) inside [-3000, 3500] with soft edges, so only weak or mid matches get a boost.\n8\t- `gate_slot`: projection on the difference of means \"fees_fx slot minus other slots\" (my 282 messages, PCs >= 16).\n9\t- `gate_topic`: projection on \"wrong-rate complaint in the fees_fx slot minus other fees_fx-slot points\" (my 76 target messages vs. my non-target messages, PCs >= 32).\n10\t- Gates are clipped ramps between the 5th and 40th percentile of my target messages; `min` is built as `a - relu(a - b)`.\n11\t\n12\t**Checks (build.py).** Evidence: 16/16 targets now fees_fx, 0/16 others changed. My own set: 64/76 targets flip, 5/206 others change (exchange-rate questions the original scorer sent to cards). Only means, differences, percentiles and forward passes were used.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ec93677f-267e-4bb2-baab-e277676defcb","uuid":"d6b43247-e5f7-4f70-a8e3-d255780438a2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T20:22:27.794Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"$WSROOT/laya/s1/fable-high-r2/step1/NOTES.md","content":"# Step 1 notes\n\n**Finding.** The marker vectors are almost one scalar: two principal components (a curved \"match score\" arc) carry 99.6% of the variance and reproduce the original logits to 0.01 RMSE. Slot identity and message topic live in tiny directions in components 16 and beyond.\n\n**Change.** The original scorer weights are untouched. I added a 4-layer ReLU module: `e = 4.5 * min(band, gate_slot, gate_topic)`.\n\n- `band`: match score (PC0) inside [-3000, 3500] with soft edges, so only weak or mid matches get a boost.\n- `gate_slot`: projection on the difference of means \"fees_fx slot minus other slots\" (my 282 messages, PCs >= 16).\n- `gate_topic`: projection on \"wrong-rate complaint in the fees_fx slot minus other fees_fx-slot points\" (my 76 target messages vs. my non-target messages, PCs >= 32).\n- Gates are clipped ramps between the 5th and 40th percentile of my target messages; `min` is built as `a - relu(a - b)`.\n\n**Checks (build.py).** Evidence: 16/16 targets now fees_fx, 0/16 others changed. My own set: 64/76 targets flip, 5/206 others change (exchange-rate questions the original scorer sent to cards). Only means, differences, percentiles and forward passes were used.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011Cij9B8WJwpECHA7uEFeSx","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
