account?\",\n    \"Can tourists open an account?\",\n    \"Is this available to people in Vietnam?\",\n    \"Can I apply if I live in Sweden?\",\n    \"Where can I use your services geographically?\",\n    \"Do you offer services in Latin America?\",\n    \"Can I get an account in Kenya?\",\n    \"Is anyone eligible regardless of country?\",\n]\n\nCONTRAST2 = [\n    # cards: cards and ATMs abroad, card brands, delivery\n    (\"cards\", \"Do you support Mastercard?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Is my card Visa or Mastercard?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use ATMs in another country?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Which ATMs can I use abroad?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Do you offer American Express cards?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use my card at any ATM?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Will my card be accepted in Europe?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Do you deliver cards internationally?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can you post my card to Germany?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I get a spare card?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"How do I link my new card to the app?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"My card payment didn't go through..\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use the card online?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Do you have a metal card?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"What are the limits on disposable cards?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I change my card design?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"How do I unblock my card?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I get a card for someone else?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use the card in shops abroad?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"I want a card that works worldwide.\"),\n    # fees_fx: currencies, rates, fees\n    (\"fx\", \"What cards and currencies do you support?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Which currencies can I top up with?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Do you support Australian dollars?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Can I hold multiple currencies?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Which countries' currencies can I exchange?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Do you support the Nigerian naira?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Is there a fee for using my card abroad?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"What are the charges for international ATM withdrawals?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Do you charge a foreign transaction fee?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Why was the exchange rate different from Google?\"),\n    # transfers\n    (\"tr\", \"Can I receive money from another country?\"),\n    (\"tr\", \"Can I send money to India?\"),\n    (\"tr\", \"Can I top up from a foreign bank account?\"),\n    (\"tr\", \"Do you support SWIFT transfers?\"),\n    (\"tr\", \"Can my employer in the US pay me here?\"),\n    (\"tr\", \"Can I transfer money to someone without an account?\"),\n    (\"tr\", \"How do I top up from a US bank?\"),\n    (\"tr\", \"Can I top up with Apple Pay?\"),\n    (\"tr\", \"Why hasn't my international transfer arrived?\"),\n    (\"tr\", \"What is the limit on transfers?\"),\n    # disputes\n    (\"disp\", \"I was charged for something while abroad that I didn't buy.\"),\n    (\"disp\", \"There is a charge from a foreign country I never visited.\"),\n    (\"disp\", \"My payment in a shop in Spain was declined.\"),\n    (\"disp\", \"The refund from a US merchant hasn't come.\"),\n    (\"disp\", \"A payment is pending from a hotel abroad.\"),\n    (\"disp\", \"I see a duplicate charge from a restaurant.\"),\n    (\"disp\", \"Someone used my card in another country.\"),\n    (\"disp\", \"My cash withdrawal abroad is showing twice.\"),\n    (\"disp\", \"Why is this transaction still pending?\"),\n    (\"disp\", \"I need help with an unrecognised card payment.\"),\n    # account_security (non-eligibility)\n    (\"as\", \"Do I need to verify my identity to open an account?\"),\n    (\"as\", \"What do I need to sign up?\"),\n    (\"as\", \"How do I prove my address?\"),\n    (\"as\", \"Can I verify my identity with a driving licence?\"),\n    (\"as\", \"Where do I upload my ID?\"),\n    (\"as\", \"I'm having trouble with the selfie verification.\"),\n    (\"as\", \"Can I use a foreign passport to verify?\"),\n    (\"as\", \"How do I change my country of residence on my account?\"),\n 