AST_TRANSFERS + CONTRAST_DISPUTES)\nALL = (TARGET + CONTRAST + TARGET2 + [m for _, m in CONTRAST2])\nLABEL = ([\"target\"] * len(TARGET)\n         + [\"as\"] * len(CONTRAST_ACCOUNT_SECURITY)\n         + [\"cards\"] * len(CONTRAST_CARDS)\n         + [\"fx\"] * len(CONTRAST_FEES_FX)\n         + [\"tr\"] * len(CONTRAST_TRANSFERS)\n         + [\"disp\"] * len(CONTRAST_DISPUTES)\n         + [\"target\"] * len(TARGET2)\n         + [g for g, _ in CONTRAST2])\nassert len(ALL) == len(LABEL)","originalFile":"\"\"\"My own messages for the step-3 correction (eligibility -> account_security).\nTARGET: who may open or use an account (age limits, supported countries).\nCONTRAST: everything else, with emphasis on the near neighbours\n(cards, currency support, card delivery abroad, identity checks).\"\"\"\n\nTARGET = [\n    # age limits\n    \"How old do I have to be to open an account?\",\n    \"Is there a minimum age for your service?\",\n    \"What is the age limit to sign up?\",\n    \"Can my 14 year old daughter have an account?\",\n    \"Do you offer accounts for teenagers?\",\n    \"Can a 16 year old get a card from you?\",\n    \"Are there junior accounts for kids?\",\n    \"My son is 12, can he use the app?\",\n    \"Do I need to be over 18 to join?\",\n    \"Is there an upper age limit for customers?\",\n    \"Can I sign up my children for an account?\",\n    \"Can minors open an account with you?\",\n    \"What age do you need to be to use the app?\",\n    \"Can my child have their own card and account?\",\n    \"I'm 17, am I allowed to register?\",\n    \"Do you accept customers under 18?\",\n    \"How young can someone be to get an account?\",\n    \"Is there an age restriction on getting a card?\",\n    \"Can I open an account for my teenage kids?\",\n    \"What are the age rules for a new account?\",\n    \"Are children allowed to use your service?\",\n    \"At what age can my kid start using your card?\",\n    \"Do you have a kids version of the account?\",\n    \"Can a student under 18 open an account?\",\n    \"Am I too young to have an account here?\",\n    \"My grandmother is 85, can she still open an account?\",\n    \"Is there an age requirement to get a card?\",\n    \"Can I create an account for my 10 year old?\",\n    \"What is the youngest age you allow?\",\n    \"Can parents open accounts for their kids?\",\n    # country support / residency\n    \"Which countries can I open an account from?\",\n    \"Is your service available in Germany?\",\n    \"Do you operate in the United States?\",\n    \"I live in Australia, can I sign up?\",\n    \"Can I get a card if I live in Canada?\",\n    \"Are you available outside of Europe?\",\n    \"What countries do you currently support?\",\n    \"I am not a UK resident, can I still open an account?\",\n    \"Do you support customers in India?\",\n    \"Can people from Brazil use your service?\",\n    \"Is the app available in my country?\",\n    \"Where in the world can I use your service?\",\n    \"Which regions do you cover?\",\n    \"Can I open an account while living abroad?\",\n    \"Do I need a UK address to get an account?\",\n    \"Is there a list of supported countries?\",\n    \"Can I join from France?\",\n    \"I moved to Spain, can I still have an account?\",\n    \"Do you offer accounts to people in Africa?\",\n    \"Can someone in Japan get one of your cards?\",\n    \"Are non residents able to open an account?\",\n    \"Can I use this service if I am in Mexico?\",\n    \"Which nationalities can open an account?\",\n    \"Does this work in South America?\",\n    \"Do you work with customers in Switzerland?\",\n    \"Is this available in Asia yet?\",\n    \"Can I get an account if I live outside the EU?\",\n    \"What countries are eligible for an account?\",\n    \"Do you have a presence in Ireland?\",\n    \"Can I open an account from the USA?\",\n    \"I'm travelling a lot, do you support my home country Norway?\",\n    \"Where are you available?\",\n    \"Can an American citizen sign up?\",\n    \"Does my country need to be on a list to get a card?\",\n    \"Can I get a card delivered if I live in Italy and want to open an account?\",\n    \"Which countries are you in?\",\n    \"Do you accept customers from New Zealand?\",\n    \"I'm based in Dubai, can I open an account?\",\n    \"Are you planning to support more countries?\",\n    \"Can I get a card even if I'm not in the UK?\",\n    \"Is it possible to join from outside Europe?\",\n    \"Do you support customers worldwide?\",\n    \"What areas do you serve?\",\n    \"Can I apply for an account from Portugal?\",\n    \"Am I eligible for an account if I live in Turkey?\",\n    \"Who is allowed to open an account with you?\",\n    \"What are the eligibility requirements for an account?\",\n    \"Can I use your service in the country I live in?\",\n    \"Is anyone from any country able to get a card?\",\n    \"Do I qualify for an account if I'm a foreign national?\",\n]\n\nCONTRAST_ACCOUNT_SECURITY = [\n    \"What forms of ID do you accept for verification?\",\n    \"Why do I need to verify my identity?\",\n    \"My identity verification keeps failing.\",\n    \"I don't have a passport, can I still verify?\",\n    \"How do I change my passcode?\",\n    \"I forgot my passcode and can't log in.\",\n    \"How do I update my phone number?\",\n    \"I need to change my address on the account.\",\n    \"I want to close my account.\",\n    \"How do I delete my account permanently?\",\n    \"I lost my phone, how do I secure my account?\",\n    \"My phone was stolen and it had the app on it.\",\n    \"Can I change the name on my account?\",\n    \"How do I edit my personal details?\",\n    \"Someone else has access to my account.\",\n    \"Can I have two accounts with you?\",\n    \"I got locked out of the app.\",\n    \"How do I update my email address?\",\n    \"The identity check is taking too long.\",\n    \"What documents do you need to verify me?\",\n    \"Can I log in on a new 