"Can I get a card in my country?\",\n    \"Is the card available to customers in Spain?\",\n    \"Can I apply for a card from Nigeria?\",\n    \"Do you offer cards in South Africa?\",\n]\nCONTRAST3 = [  # cards: using or receiving a card abroad\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use my card in Germany?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Will my card work abroad?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I pay with the card in the US?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Is my card accepted in Japan?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I withdraw cash abroad with the card?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Does the card work in every country?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use the card in shops in Europe?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Where can I use my card?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use the card to pay in another currency?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can you deliver my card to Canada?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"How long will my card take to arrive in Australia?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I get the card sent to a different country?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Will my card arrive before my trip to Spain?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"I'm travelling, can I use my card there?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I pay in Japan with my virtual card?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can my partner use my card?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I get a card for my wife?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"My card got declined abroad.\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Do I need to tell you before I use my card abroad?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use my card at ATMs in France?\"),\n]\n\nCONTRAST = (CONTRAST_ACCOUNT_SECURITY + CONTRAST_CARDS + CONTRAST_FEES_FX\n            + CONTRAST_TRANSFERS + CONTRAST_DISPUTES)\nALL = (TARGET + CONTRAST + TARGET2 + [m for _, m in CONTRAST2] + TARGET3 + [m for _, m in CONTRAST3])","originalFile":"\"\"\"My own messages for the step-3 correction (eligibility -> account_security).\nTARGET: who may open or use an account (age limits, supported countries).\nCONTRAST: everything else, with emphasis on the near neighbours\n(cards, currency support, card delivery abroad, identity checks).\"\"\"\n\nTARGET = [\n    # age limits\n    \"How old do I have to be to open an account?\",\n    \"Is there a minimum age for your service?\",\n    \"What is the age limit to sign up?\",\n    \"Can my 14 year old daughter have an account?\",\n    \"Do you offer accounts for teenagers?\",\n    \"Can a 16 year old get a card from you?\",\n    \"Are there junior accounts for kids?\",\n    \"My son is 12, can he use the app?\",\n    \"Do I need to be over 18 to join?\",\n    \"Is there an upper age limit for customers?\",\n    \"Can I sign up my children for an account?\",\n    \"Can minors open an account with you?\",\n    \"What age do you need to be to use the app?\",\n    \"Can my child have their own card and account?\",\n    \"I'm 17, am I allowed to register?\",\n    \"Do you accept customers under 18?\",\n    \"How young can someone be to get an account?\",\n    \"Is there an age restriction on getting a card?\",\n    \"Can I open an account for my teenage kids?\",\n    \"What are the age rules for a new account?\",\n    \"Are children allowed to use your service?\",\n    \"At what age can my kid start using your card?\",\n    \"Do you have a kids version of the account?\",\n    \"Can a student under 18 open an account?\",\n    \"Am I too young to have an account here?\",\n    \"My grandmother is 85, can she still open an account?\",\n    \"Is there an age requirement to get a card?\",\n    \"Can I create an account for my 10 year old?\",\n    \"What is the youngest age you allow?\",\n    \"Can parents open accounts for their kids?\",\n    # country support / residency\n    \"Which countries can I open an account from?\",\n    \"Is your service available in Germany?\",\n    \"Do you operate in the United States?\",\n    \"I live in Australia, can I sign up?\",\n    \"Can I get a card if I live in Canada?\",\n    \"Are you available outside of Europe?\",\n    \"What countries do you currently support?\",\n    \"I am not a UK resident, can I still open an account?\",\n    \"Do you support customers in India?\",\n    \"Can people from Brazil use your service?\",\n    \"Is the app available in my country?\",\n    \"Where in the world can I use your service?\",\n    \"Which regions do you cover?\",\n    \"Can I open an account while living abroad?\",\n    \"Do I need a UK address to get an account?\",\n    \"Is there a list of supported countries?\",\n    \"Can I join from France?\",\n    \"I moved to Spain, can I still have an account?\",\n    \"Do you offer accounts to people in Africa?\",\n    \"Can someone in Japan get one of your cards?\",\n    \"Are non residents able to open an account?\",\n    \"Can I use this service if I am in Mexico?\",\n    \"Which nationalities can open an account?\",\n    \"Does this work in South America?\",\n    \"Do you work with customers in Switzerland?\",\n    \"Is this available in Asia yet?\",\n    \"Can I get an account if I live outside the EU?\",\n    \"What countries are eligible for an account?\",\n    \"Do you have a presence in Ireland?\",\n    \"Can I open an account from the USA?\",\n    \"I'm travelling a lot, do you support my home country Norway?\",\n    \"Where are you available?\",\n    \"Can an American citizen sign up?\",\n    \"Does my country need to be on a list to get a card?\",\n    \"Can I get a card delivered if I live in Italy and want to open an account?\",\n    \"Which countries are you in?\",\n    \"Do you accept customers from New Zealand?\",\n    \"I'm based in Dubai, can I open an account?\",\n    \"Are you planning to support more countries?\",\n    \"Can I get a card even if I'm not in the UK?\",\n    \"Is it possible to join from outside Europe?\",\n    \"Do you support customers worldwide?\",\n    \"What areas do you serve?\",\n    \"Can I apply for an account from Portugal?\",\n    \"Am I eligible for an account if I live in Turkey?\",\n    \"Who is allowed to open an account with you?\",\n    \"What are the eligibility requirements for an account?\",\n    \"Can I use your service in the country I live in?\",\n    \"Is anyone from any country able to get a card?\",\n    \"Do I qualify for an account if I'm a foreign national?\",\n]\n\nCONTRAST_ACCOUNT_SECURITY = [\n    \"What forms of ID do you accept for verification?\",\n    \"Why do I need to verify my identity?\",\n    \"My identity verification keeps failing.\",\n    \"I don't have a passport, can I still verify?\",\n    \"How do I change my passcode?\",\n    \"I forgot my passcode and can't log in.\",\n    \"How do I update my phone number?\",\n    \"I need to change my address on the account.\",\n    \"I want to close my account.\",\n    \"How do I delete my account permanently?\",\n    \"I lost my phone, how do I secure my account?\",\n    \"My phone was stolen and it had the app on it.\",\n    \"Can I change the name on my account?\",\n    \"How do I edit my personal details?\",\n    \"Someone else has access to my account.\",\n    \"Can I have two accounts with you?\",\n    \"I got locked out of the app.\",\n    \"How do I update my email address?\",\n    \"The identity check is taking too long.\",\n    \"What documents do you need to verify me?\",\n    \"Can I log in on a new device?\",\n    \"I want to reset my password.\",\n    \"How long does identity verification take?\",\n    \"Do I need to upload a selfie for verification?\",\n    \"I need to update my date of birth, it is wrong.\",\n]\n\nCONTRAST_CARDS = [\n    \"How do I order a new card?\",\n    \"My card hasn't arrived yet.\",\n    \"How long does card delivery take?\",\n    \"I am express delivering my card to the US, how long will it take?\",\n    \"Can you ship my card to my holiday address in Spain?\",\n    \"Can I get my card delivered to France?\",\n    \"How do I activate my new card?\",\n    \"Where do I get a virtual card?\",\n    \"How many disposable cards can I create per day?\",\n    \"My contactless isn't working.\",\n    \"Can I add my card to Apple Pay?\",\n    \"How do I set up Google Pay?\",\n    \"I lost my card, please block it.\",\n    \"My card was stolen.\",\n    \"How do I replace a damaged card?\",\n    \"My card is about to expire, what happens?\",\n    \"Which merchants accept my card?\",\n    \"Can I use my card abroad?\",\n    \"Will my card work in the US when I travel?\",\n    \"Can I use my card in Japan on holiday?\",\n    \"Why was my card declined at the shop?\",\n    \"I need a physical card as well as the virtual one.\",\n    \"Can I track my card delivery?\",\n    \"How do I change my card PIN?\",\n    \"My PIN is blocked.\",\n    \"Is there a fee for a replacement card?\",\n    \"Can I have a second card for my partner?\",\n    \"I want to cancel my card.\",\n    \"My virtual card is not working online.\",\n    \"How do I freeze my card?\",\n    \"What does the card look like?\",\n    \"Can I order a card in a different colour?\",\n    \"Do you send cards by post or courier?\",\n    \"I need my card soon, can it be expedited?\",\n    \"I would like to track the card you sent to me.\",\n    \"Can I get a card with a different name on it?\",\n    \"My card is linked to the wrong account.\",\n    \"Does the card support contactless payments?\",\n    \"Can I get a card for my business trips?\",\n    \"How do I get a card for my second account?\",\n]\n\nCONTRAST_FEES_FX = [\n    \"Which currencies do you support?\",\n    \"Can I hold US dollars in my account?\",\n    \"Do you support Japanese yen?\",\n    \"What exchange rate do you use?\",\n    \"Is there a fee for exchanging currency?\",\n    \"Can I exchange euros to pounds in the app?\",\n    \"What fees do you charge for ATM withdrawals abroad?\",\n    \"Why was I charged a fee on this transfer?\",\n    \"What is your fee for international payments?\",\n    \"Can I add a new currency to my account?\",\n    \"Which fiat currencies can I hold?\",\n    \"Is there a monthly charge for the account?\",\n    \"The exchange rate on my card payment was bad.\",\n    \"What currencies can I exchange between?\",\n    \"Do you charge for currency conversion on weekends?\",\n    \"Why is there an extra fee on my statement?\",\n    \"Can I keep money in Swiss francs?\",\n    \"Do you support Indian rupees?\",\n    \"How many currencies are available?\",\n    \"What is the rate for GBP to USD today?\",\n]\n\nCONTRAST_TRANSFERS = [\n    \"How do I top up my account?\",\n    \"Can I top up with a bank transfer?\",\n    \"My transfer hasn't arrived.\",\n    \"How do I send money to a friend?\",\n    \"Can I receive money from abroad?\",\n    \"My balance didn't update after my deposit.\",\n    \"How long does a bank transfer take?\",\n    \"Can I top up with a credit card?\",\n    \"I sent money to the wrong account.\",\n    \"Can I transfer money to someone in another country?\",\n    \"Where is my pending top up?\",\n    \"How do I get my salary paid into this account?\",\n    \"Can I top up by cheque?\",\n    \"Why did my transfer fail?\",\n    \"How do I set up a direct debit?\",\n    \"Can I send money to a US bank account?\",\n    \"The top up from my card is not showing.\",\n    \"What are the details for receiving a transfer?\",\n    \"Can I deposit cash?\",\n    \"How do I cancel a transfer?\",\n]\n\nCONTRAST_DISPUTES = [\n    \"There is a payment I don't recognise.\",\n    \"I was charged twice for the same thing.\",\n    \"My card payment was declined but the money is gone.\",\n    \"A cash withdrawal is showing that I didn't make.\",\n    \"My refund hasn't appeared yet.\",\n    \"This payment is still pending after a week.\",\n    \"I want to dispute a transaction.\",\n    \"A direct debit was taken that I didn't authorise.\",\n    \"The merchant refunded me but I don't see it.\",\n    \"Why was my payment reverted?\",\n    \"I see a strange charge from a shop I never visited.\",\n    \"My ATM withdrawal shows twice.\",\n    \"A transaction was cancelled but the money hasn't come back.\",\n    \"Can you reverse a payment I made by mistake?\",\n    \"I got charged by a subscription I cancelled.\",\n    \"My payment was declined at the restaurant.\",\n    \"Who do I talk to about a wrong charge?\",\n    \"The amount on my receipt is different from what was taken.\",\n    \"I never got the refund from the shop.\",\n    \"A withdrawal I did not make appeared today.\",\n]\n\nTARGET2 = [\n    \"What's the minimum age to open an account?\",\n    \"Can I get my 15 year old an account?\",\n    \"Is the service open to people under 18?\",\n    \"Is there an age requirement for using the app?\",\n    \"Can my kids have accounts linked to mine?\",\n    \"Do I have to be an adult to sign up?\",\n    \"How old must you be to get a card?\",\n    \"Are there any age restrictions?\",\n    \"Can a 13 year old use this?\",\n    \"Is there a children's account option?\",\n    \"Can my teenager have a card?\",\n    \"My daughter is 16, is she eligible?\",\n    \"Is the app suitable for kids?\",\n    \"What is the age policy for new customers?\",\n    \"Can elderly people open accounts without issue?\",\n    \"Can I register my little brother who is 11?\",\n    \"Are under 16s allowed to have an account?\",\n    \"Do you offer accounts for people under 18?\",\n    \"Does my child need to be a certain age for a card?\",\n    \"What ages can use this service?\",\n    \"Can I use this in the USA?\",\n    \"Do you support Canada?\",\n    \"Is the service offered in Nigeria?\",\n    \"I live in Poland, can I have an account?\",\n    \"Do you have customers in Singapore?\",\n    \"Are you available in Scandinavia?\",\n    \"Can residents of Greece sign up?\",\n    \"What countries are you available in?\",\n    \"Which countries can use the app?\",\n    \"Can I sign up if I am from Argentina?\",\n    \"Do you work in the Middle East?\",\n    \"Is it available in Russia?\",\n    \"Can I open an account from South Korea?\",\n    \"Is the app supported in my region?\",\n    \"Which countries can sign up?\",\n    \"Is there a country restriction?\",\n    \"Do you support accounts for people living in China?\",\n    \"Are you available in the whole EU?\",\n    \"Can someone living in Egypt get an account?\",\n    \"Do you accept applicants from Pakistan?\",\n    \"Can I use your service from Thailand?\",\n    \"Which countries is the card available in?\",\n    \"I am Dutch, can I open an account?\",\n    \"Do you serve customers in Hong Kong?\",\n    \"Is this a UK only service?\",\n    \"Can non-UK citizens open an account?\",\n    \"Do I have to live in Europe to use this?\",\n    \"Can expats open an account?\",\n    \"Is your service global?\",\n    \"Will you ever come to Australia?\",\n    \"Can I have an account if I am a US citizen living in London?\",\n    \"Do you support customers from every country?\",\n    \"What are the residency requirements for an account?\",\n    \"Can tourists open an account?\",\n    \"Is this available to people in Vietnam?\",\n    \"Can I apply if I live in Sweden?\",\n    \"Where can I use your services geographically?\",\n    \"Do you offer services in Latin America?\",\n    \"Can I get an account in Kenya?\",\n    \"Is anyone eligible regardless of country?\",\n]\n\nCONTRAST2 = [\n    # cards: cards and ATMs abroad, card brands, delivery\n    (\"cards\", \"Do you support Mastercard?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Is my card Visa or Mastercard?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use ATMs in another country?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Which ATMs can I use abroad?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Do you offer American Express cards?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use my card at any ATM?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Will my card be accepted in Europe?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Do you deliver cards internationally?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can you post my card to Germany?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I get a spare card?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"How do I link my new card to the app?\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"My card payment didn't go through..\"),\n    (\"cards\", \"Can I use the card online?\"),\n    (\"