 \"how old do u have to be\",\n    \"whats the minimum age\",\n    \"can my kid get an account\",\n    \"my son is 15 can he open an account\",\n    \"Is there a minimum age to join?\",\n    \"do i need to be 18\",\n    \"can a minor use this\",\n    \"Do you let teenagers open accounts?\",\n    \"is 16 old enough for an account\",\n    \"What age can you sign up at?\",\n    \"can children have their own account\",\n    \"Is there an age limit for opening an account?\",\n    \"How old does my daughter need to be?\",\n    \"Can under 18s get a card?\",\n    \"are kids allowed\",\n    \"Is there a youth account?\",\n    \"What's the age restriction?\",\n    \"Can my 17 year old get an account?\",\n    \"Do you need to be an adult to use the app?\",\n    \"Can I get an account for my child who is 13?\",\n    \"at what age can someone open an account\",\n    \"Can I open an account for my son?\",\n    \"Is there a maximum age for the service?\",\n    \"can my teenager use this app\",\n    \"Do you offer anything for children under 12?\",\n    \"I'm 16, can I get a card?\",\n    \"How old do I need to be to have a card?\",\n    \"Is there any age requirement?\",\n    \"can a 14 year old open an account\",\n    \"Can I set up an account for my kids?\",\n]\nCONTRAST4 = [\n    # fees_fx: currency support, banking77 style\n    (\"fx\", \"What currencies can I use?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Is the euro supported?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Can I hold yen in my account?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"What fiat currencies do you accept?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Do you support USD?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Can I exchange to rupees?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"which currencies do u support\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Do you support the Canadian dollar?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Can I keep money in Mexican pesos?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Is the Brazilian real supported?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"What currencies are available for exchange?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Can I top up in Swiss francs?\"),\n    (\"fx\", \"Do you support the Polish zloty?\"),\n 