{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgiZ3VtMJLHNRxUA1a47f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XrxeHQPq3HqAiciR3LDhU9","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"$WSROOT/laya/s1/fable-high-r2/step3/NOTES.md","content":"# Step 3 notes\n\n**Change.** The original scorer and the step-1 and step-2 pathways are untouched. I appended a third block-diagonal pathway (12 -> 3 -> 1 units) that adds `e3 = 6 * AND(slot gates, OR(topic gates))` to the logit.\n\n- Units: PCA of my 480 messages (2400 marker vectors), each PC in units of its own standard deviation.\n- Slot gates: four pairwise differences of means \"account_security slot minus slot j\" (PCs 2-63), each a ramp that starts above the maximum of slot j. Their AND is zero on every other slot, so nothing but the account_security logit can move.\n- Topic gates (account_security slot, PCs 8-255): \"my 230 eligibility messages minus my 250 other messages\", OR \"my 48 card-worded eligibility messages minus my 95 cards messages\". Each ramp starts at the 99th percentile of my contrast messages. OR is `min(1, a+b)`, AND is `relu(a+b-1)`.\n\n**Checks (final.py).** Evidence: 15/16 eligibility messages now route to account_security (miss: \"Can I use this all over the world?\"), 0/16 others changed. Step-1 and step-2 evidence sets: 0 changes. Split-half on my own messages: 86% of held-out eligibility messages flip, 3% of held-out near-neighbour contrasts change, no leak onto other slots. Only means, standard deviations, percentiles and forward passes were used.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4604,"cache_read_input_tokens":214609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4604},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],